# --- control-room ----------------------------------------------------------
# Everything under data/ is runtime state: the site registry (zone and site
# ids), tokens saved from the settings page, the password hash and session
# secret, cached favicons and titles, and saved runs with their screenshots.
# None of it belongs in a public repo, so the whole directory is ignored rather
# than a list that has to be kept in step with whatever the app writes next.
data/
